/**
 * Build the lil-gui control panel.
 * @param {object} lens   - CONTRACT 2 lens object; mutated in place on every control change.
 * @param {function} onChange - called as onChange(lens) after every mutation.
 * @returns {{ gui: GUI }}
 */

// Visual tuning — EYES-ONLY, adjust to taste (Brandon's dial).
// Nodes self-glow with their own color so they're visible regardless of scene
// lighting. Raise BASE for brighter, lower for moodier. HILITE = highlighted pulse.

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Geometry factory — maps shape name to a unit-scale THREE geometry.
// mesh.scale carries the size channel; geometry is the shape channel.
// Extension point: add entries here as the shape vocabulary grows.

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Cluster force factory — nudges nodes on x and z toward the centroid of
// their clusterBy group. y is never nudged because it may be pinned.
// Extension point: if x or z become pinnable, gate their nudge here too,
// mirroring the y exclusion.

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------
  // Mesh builder — called by nodeThreeObject on initial render and on any
  // library-triggered node rebuild. Always reads currentLens, so a forced
  // rebuild after applyLens produces correctly styled meshes.
  // -------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------
  // Cluster force — registered now with the default lens; replaced on each
  // applyLens call. d3-force calls force.initialize(nodes) on registration,
  // so the force always holds the simulation's live node list.
  // -------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------
  // Pulse loop — bare rAF so it runs at a steady 60 fps regardless of
  // simulation temperature. Highlights matching nodes with a sin-wave scale
  // and emissive glow; resets non-matching to base state.
  // -------------------------------------------------------------------------

// Only reset scale/emissive when not currently highlighted.
      // Highlighted nodes are under pulse-loop control; resetting here would
      // cause a one-frame pop before the next pulse tick corrects it.

// Y-pin: map yFor result (0..1 or null) to a y position.
    // null → undefined (free); otherwise centred around 0 with ±Y_SPAN/2 range.
    // x and z are intentionally left free (fx/fz undefined).
    //
    // Extension point: to add an x or z pin, mirror the fy block exactly:

//
// scoreFor(node, lens) → number in 0..1
//
// Weighted average of the lens score terms over the node's NORMALIZED metrics
// (node.n, each already 0..1 or null — produced by data.js per CONTRACT 1).
//
// Per CONTRACT 2, lens.score = { wAge, wRecency, wChurn, wEnergy, wUrgent, wImportant },
// each weight 0..1. The term→metric mapping is FROZEN by the spec:
//
//     wAge       → n.age
//     wRecency   → n.recency
//     wChurn     → n.churn
//     wEnergy    → n.energy
//     wUrgent    → n.urgent
//     wImportant → n.important
//
// Rule: sum (weight * value) over terms where weight > 0 AND value is non-null,
// divide by the sum of those qualifying weights. If nothing qualifies, return 0.
